    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***4 BEDROOM BUNGALOW AND GARAGE ON C.0.64 ACRES***\r\n\r\nKillian Lynch Auctioneers are pleased to present this spacious 4 bedroom bungalow and garage set on a private site of C.0.64 acres. The property which comprises of C.1,700 sq ft living accommodation boasts a bright open plan kitchen/dining room, generous living room and also has a converted attic. This attractive family home offers countryside living while remaining within each reach of local amenities. Located only C.5km from Terelton village, C.10 minutes drive to Macroom town and C.40 minutes drive to Cork city. Viewings highly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.7m x 2.2m \r\nWooden flooring. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.6m x 5.3m \r\nWooden flooring, open fire with cast iron surrounding. \r\n\r\nHallway - 7.6m x 1.1m \r\nWooden flooring, hot press.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 8.6m x 4.5m \r\nTiled wooden flooring, fitted kitchen, worktop, sink, integrated Zanussi oven, hob and extractor fan, sliding door to side gardens. \r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.4m x 1.8m \r\nTiled flooring, fitted storage unit, worktop, sink, stira to converted attic.\r\n\r\nW.C - 2.6m x 1.2m \r\nTiled flooring, W.C, WHB, heated towel rack.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.4m x 3.4m \r\nWooden flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m x 3.0m \r\nWooden flooring, fitted wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.6m x 2.8m \r\nWooden flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.8m x 3.3m \r\nWooden flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.3m x 2.0m \r\nTiled throughout, W.C, WHB, bath, power shower, heated towel rack, velux window.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil fired central heating.\r\nPrivate water and drainage.\r\nESB\r\nC.50 sqm garage.\r\nConverted attic."
      },
